SY_TALK("TNBqYEdTOvs",[[0,["The subject"]],[2,["that has been placed before you today"]],[8,["is most fascinating and absorbing:"]],[16,["Kundalini and Jesus Christ, Lord Jesus Christ. For ordinary,"]],[22,["common people this is something entirely new,"]],[27,["and till this day no one has ever drawn any"]],[31,["connection between the two in this manner."]],[37,["The reason for this"]],[47,["is that whenever flowers have blossomed"]],[51,["upon the tree of Dharma,"]],[54,["they have spread their fragrance through many provinces,"]],[61,["many countries, and many languages."]],[65,["But what relationship they bore to one another —"]],[70,["that only the tree itself can know."]],[76,["Wherever they blossomed, wherever their fragrance spread,"]],[81,["the people there never truly accepted them. So how, then,"]],[87,["could others ever know or understand"]],[91,["that these flowers all bloom upon one and the same tree?"]],[96,["Now I am speaking to you"]],[99,["from that direction"]],[101,["to which you"]],[103,["have not yet been brought."]],[105,["Once you reach there, you will understand My words very easily. For at present"]],[112,["you have no way of knowing whether what I am saying is true or untrue;"]],[118,["you possess no proof of it."]],[121,["How will you know whether what I say is true or false?"]],[126,["The way to know it is this — and the difficulty is that"]],[131,["you have not yet learned to discover your own meaning."]],[135,["You are not yet at that"]],[137,["level where you have become connected with the Truth."]],[141,["For this very reason you cannot tell whether a thing is true or false,"]],[146,["whether it is mere legend or something fashioned by the mind."]],[151,["Those who, as we say, have become realized —"]],[154,["they can come to know fully which thing is true and which is false."]],[159,["Because of the vibrations that flow from their"]],[162,["hands — the experiment we conducted here yesterday,"]],[166,["when these vibrations began to flow"]],[168,["from the hands of so many people —"]],[171,["if you observe and weigh this carefully, you"]],[174,["will understand that what I am telling you is the complete Truth."]],[178,["Christians know of Jesus Christ only"]],[180,["through the Bible, which is a most profound book. Its depth is so great that,"]],[186,["being unable to grasp its meaning,"]],[188,["these people make all sorts of attempts at interpretation."]],[192,["For instance, it is written in the Bible, \"I"]],[195,["will appear before you like tongues of flames.\" They cannot give the"]],[200,["meaning of this. They imagine that when God appears before them,"]],[204,["such flames will come pouring out of Him. But that is not its meaning."]],[209,["Its meaning is this: I shall become visible to you in the Sahasrara."]],[214,["It is a description of the Sahasrara."]],[216,["The Kundalini is described in many ways in the Bible."]],[220,["I can give you countless quotations from it."]],[224,["Jesus Christ has said, \"Those who are not against Me are with Me\""]],[228,["— those who are not in opposition to Me are with Me."]],[232,["If you go and ask the Christians who these people are, they do not know."]],[238,["They have made it out"]],[242,["that Jesus Christ said, \"I am the path, I am the door\""]],[247,["— I am the way and I am the door."]],[250,["But He did not say, \"I am the destination\" —"]],[254,["He never said that He was the goal. If He said,"]],[259,["\"I am the way and I am the door,\" then the destination must"]],[264,["be something beyond. Even after speaking in such profound language,"]],[270,["the wicked people of that time —"]],[272,["within four years, they let Him live only four years —"]],[277,["within four years they nailed Him upon the cross."]],[281,["And even today, those who believe in Him"]],[284,["and say that they follow His religion go on, every single day, sacrificing all that"]],[291,["He truly stood for."]],[293,["As I told you yesterday, the Hindus are just as foolish, and so are the Muslims,"]],[300,["and so are the Christians."]],[303,["About this Jesus Christ — if you could ever read the Devi Bhagavata,"]],[309,["you would discover there"]],[311,["that Shri Radha created Him out of Her own inner strength,"]],[317,["and gave Him the name Mahavishnu."]],[319,["She made it in two parts — She formed it as an egg-shape."]],[325,["The base of this egg-shape is Shri Ganesha."]],[328,["It is Shri Ganesha who is fundamentally"]],[332,["the power of Jesus Christ."]],[334,["And the other part of the egg-shape — the one we call Shadanana, Shanmukhanana —"]],[339,["that is called Kartikeya."]],[341,["The very life-breath within this whole egg is Jesus Christ."]],[345,["The complete Brahma tattwa, the Omkara — that itself is Jesus Christ."]],[350,["The entire existence of the Kundalini is, one may say, because of Him."]],[355,["And it is He who is seated at the very base of the Kundalini."]],[359,["Shri Radha gave Him birth."]],[361,["You will come to know this if you read the Devi Purana."]],[365,["But where are our modern people of today ready to read Markandeya!"]],[370,["You will not find a seer like Markandeya however much you may search."]],[375,["He has described the most subtle, intricate things"]],[378,["about the Devi — what the marks of the Devi are,"]],[382,["how the Devi dresses, what the Devi delights in, how She is, Her"]],[386,["ways and bearing, Her nature. Sometimes one is"]],[389,["filled with wonder at how he came to know so much."]],[394,["But our modern people of today,"]],[396,["educated in English learning, are not even willing"]],[400,["to accept that there exists in this world such"]],[403,["a thing as the Devi, or such a thing as divine power."]],[407,["Although today the English are turning in this direction,"]],[411,["our Indians are still being very great Englishmen. I say many times that,"]],[416,["leaving aside the country of the English themselves,"]],[420,["there are more Englishmen here in our India. I think"]],[425,["very few among you would have read the Markandeya Purana."]],[429,["But if you read in it the establishment of Mahavishnu —"]],[434,["if you give your attention to that — you will understand that"]],[438,["this whole thing is none other than a description of Christ,"]],[443,["of the Christ."]],[445,["Shri Radha created Him by Her own power, which is the power of Mahalakshmi."]],[450,["And His mother, who was Mary, was none other than"]],[454,["— you should simply understand this directly — Shri Radha Herself."]],[459,["It was Shri Radha Herself, in person, who gave birth to Him."]],[463,["Radha — \"Ra\" means energy, Shakti; and"]],[466,["\"dha\" means the one who holds and sustains it."]],[469,["She who held the power within Herself, She is Radha. This Radha is a form"]],[475,["of Mahalakshmi. Shri Radha incarnated upon this earth."]],[478,["She who was earlier Shri Sita became Shri Radha."]],[481,["And it was Shri Radha who took Shri Ganesha into Her lap — because"]],[485,["Shri Radha is the Incarnation of Mahalakshmi,"]],[488,["and Shri Ganesha had been created by Mahakali,"]],[491,["in the form of Gauri — She took Him into Her lap, and giving Him this special form,"]],[496,["She made Him Krishta. Now this word \"Krishta\" too comes from Krishna,"]],[501,["because His father is Shri Krishna;"]],[503,["that is why He was called Krishta. This is something to be understood very deeply."]],[509,["And His name Jesus was created in this way too:"]],[512,["the thought came to Shri Radha that the name Yashoda had never appeared"]],[517,["anywhere until now. Yashoda — \"yash\" meaning fame and \"de\" meaning"]],[521,["to give, the one who gives fame, and so Yashoda."]],[524,["But if we look here in our own country,"]],[527,["He is called Yeshu and Jeshu, in short form."]],[530,["If the name Yashoda is used in U.P."]],[532,["and such places, it is shortened to Jasu. That very name, Jasu,"]],[537,["is what She gave to Him. In this way the name Jesus Christ came into being."]],[546,["Now Hindu people feel that Jesus Christ has, after all, become one of our own."]],[551,["But are you even Hindu? You are not even really Indian."]],[555,["And Hindutva does not mean to quarrel over some thing —"]],[559,["that is not Hindutva at all."]],[561,["Hindutva is understood to belong to the worshippers of Shakti."]],[565,["Only those who are flooded with Shakti, who are"]],[568,["cultured and sanctified by Shakti, are to be regarded as Hindus."]],[573,["Those within whom the Shakti has not yet been"]],[576,["awakened cannot be regarded as Hindus."]],[578,["In this way you can understand that Jesus Christ is a very great Incarnation,"]],[584,["created by Shri Radha,"]],[585,["from the time of Vaikuntha."]],[587,["It is described of Him that Shri Radha created Him."]],[591,["Out of that, He was then divided into two parts."]],[594,["One part She left just as it was, which was the part of Shri Ganesha."]],[599,["And the other part She gave a special form —"]],[602,["that egg She gave the form of a child."]],[604,["Then this child kept weeping for many years."]],[607,["He remembered his father."]],[609,["When his father saw him — that is, when Krishna, Shri Krishna, saw him —"]],[614,["He granted him many boons."]],[616,["One of these boons is this: \"You shall sit higher than Me.\""]],[620,["See, our Vishuddhi chakra is here,"]],[623,["and our Agnya chakra is here."]],[625,["But in the brain, the Vishuddhi chakra is here."]],[628,["The seat of the Vishuddhi chakra inside the brain is here."]],[632,["Yet in terms of the chakras,"]],[634,["Shri Krishna's chakra is this one, and"]],[637,["above it, here, is the Agnya chakra,"]],[640,["where Jesus Christ is seated."]],[642,["The second thing He said was: \"You shall remain the foundation of the entire world.\""]],[649,["The third thing He said was: \"Whatever I"]],[652,["receive in My Puja, a sixteenth part of it already goes to you first.\""]],[657,["In this way, after granting many boons, the Virata, Shri Krishna,"]],[662,["gave Him permission to take incarnation in this world."]],[666,["When Jesus Christ speaks of his father, He is speaking of Krishna,"]],[671,["He is speaking of the Virata."]],[673,["He always spoke of his father, because his father"]],[676,["had not incarnated together with him in this world."]],[680,["His mother was, in person,"]],[681,["the Adi Shakti of Mahalakshmi Herself."]],[684,["It is She whom He called the Holy Ghost."]],[687,["But at that time He did not speak of the Holy Ghost, and for this reason:"]],[692,["He did not reveal His mother to the world"]],[695,["as the Holy Ghost or as any Goddess. Because if the wicked"]],[698,["rakshasas of that time had come to know that"]],[701,["she is the Holy Ghost, they would have gone after her. And had such a situation"]],[706,["arisen, then Jesus Christ Himself would have become so enraged that He would have"]],[712,["taken up all the powers of destruction that He has and laid"]],[715,["everything utterly to waste. Jesus Christ"]],[718,["has eleven Rudras, meaning eleven powers of destruction."]],[722,["They are the eleven destructive powers upon our forehead."]],[726,["These eleven destructive powers —"]],[728,["when the Incarnation of Kalki comes,"]],[731,["about which I am going to tell you tomorrow —"]],[734,["will then completely carry out whatever work"]],[737,["of destruction is to be done in this world."]],[740,["These eleven destructive powers of His are seated in our forehead."]],[744,["Among them, one power is that of Shri"]],[747,["Hanumana, and one power is that of Shri Bhairavanatha,"]],[751,["who are called Gabriel and Michael in the Bible."]],[753,["Even if you say it in English,"]],[755,["you can still awaken that power through the mantra."]],[758,["Or whether you say it in Hindi or in Sanskrit,"]],[761,["that power can still be awakened within you."]],[763,["That is to say, on your right side, the Pingala nadi, the Hanumana power flows."]],[768,["When your right side is not working and there is trouble in it,"]],[771,["then one has to take the name of Hanumana."]],[774,["At that time, even if you take the name of Gabriel,"]],[777,["that power still begins to work."]],[779,["As for the power on the left side, there the power of"]],[782,["Saint Michael — or the one whom we call Shri Bhairavanatha — flows."]],[786,["If you wish to set the left side working, then you have to take the support"]],[790,["of Shri Bhairavanatha. Even if you take the name of Saint Michael,"]],[794,["you can still set this power working."]],[796,["Or you can test it through the mantra;"]],[798,["you can verify for yourself whether what I am saying is correct or not."]],[802,["In this way you can understand that those"]],[805,["who consider themselves Christians, or Hindus,"]],[807,["or Muslims, and quarrel among themselves"]],[810,["over worthless matters, are utterly foolish. Because,"]],[814,["having grown upon one and the same tree,"]],[816,["all these are relatives of one another."]],[819,["Jesus Christ has said that \"those who"]],[821,["are not against me are with me.\""]],[824,["All of this is speaking of those deities who reside upon our various chakras."]],[829,["They are all relatives of one another. It is only"]],[832,["our own relationship that does not connect with them."]],[835,["So we cling to each one separately — just as you would pluck a flower off a tree,"]],[841,["draw out its living essence,"]],[843,["and then go on fighting among ourselves holding those dead flowers."]],[847,["This is the kind of state we are in."]],[849,["You will be surprised to know that in Sahaja Yoga the awakening of the Kundalini"]],[855,["depends very much upon the Agnya chakra."]],[857,["Most of the people who"]],[859,["are moving about in the world these days"]],[862,["carry a heavy stamp of ego upon them, because, by and large,"]],[865,["we get caught up in our activities through the ego. It is the ego that pushes"]],[870,["us into something,"]],[872,["and it is to feed that very ego that we have gone on doing whatever we have done."]],[877,["So if this ego is to be set right, we have to"]],[879,["remember Lord Jesus Christ."]],[881,["When I apply sindoor to each one of you here, you will be surprised"]],[885,["to know that it is the very chakra of Lord Jesus Christ that I am moving,"]],[890,["the very chakra that I am awakening."]],[892,["This tika that you see on My forehead is the tika of His very blood;"]],[897,["it is the symbol of it. That is why this red colour carries such great significance."]],[902,["In this blood lies that symbol"]],[904,["which showed that God gave His only begotten Son to this world,"]],[908,["and you drenched Him in blood."]],[911,["It is His sign, so that you may repent, and feel"]],[914,["sorrow over your foolishness and over your wickedness,"]],[917,["and reflect upon it: what is this that we have done?"]],[921,["We think that Shri Mataji has applied sindoor, or that we have applied sindoor,"]],[925,["so it must be some sign of the Hindus."]],[927,["But if you read about John's Revelation in the Bible,"]],[930,["you will understand, for it is written there"]],[933,["that this mark will remain upon those people"]],[936,["when Kalki comes, mounted upon a white horse, carrying these eleven Rudras."]],[940,["They did not write down the name of Kalki;"]],[942,["they said that He will have His very own name,"]],[945,["and that He alone will know it."]],[947,["But when He comes upon the white horse, then they"]],[950,["will come to know whose mark is upon your forehead."]],[952,["By that mark they will recognize who this is."]],[955,["There is even a great deal said about Me in it"]],[958,["— in what manner Sahaja Yoga will come about, and in what manner people"]],[962,["will receive it, and in what manner the"]],[964,["Holy Ghost Himself will come and grant these people their realization."]],[968,["Because the Incarnation of Jesus Christ took place before us,"]],[972,["He has spoken about this matter in the most elaborate detail."]],[975,["Just as Mohammed Sahib explained, in a very"]],[978,["elaborate manner, the awakening of the Kundalini"]],[981,["and the warding off of evil forces and so on, describing their"]],[985,["workings; in the very same way Jesus Christ explained, in a"]],[989,["very simple manner, what the weapon of a human being"]],[993,["is. According to Him, the greatest weapon of a human being is to forgive."]],[997,["That which works invisibly in the principle of Shri"]],[1001,["Ganesha, the same thing comes into the human principle and works in the form"]],[1006,["of forgiveness. Forgiveness is in truth a very great weapon, by"]],[1010,["which a human being is saved from his own ego."]],[1013,["Suppose someone has given you great sorrow, or insulted you, or troubled you,"]],[1019,["or caused you harm — then your ego is wounded by it."]],[1022,["At that moment, if you hold any such feeling in your mind towards him,"]],[1027,["or if you keep thinking in this way,"]],[1029,["that this man did such an injustice to me,"]],[1032,["and you go on dwelling on him day and night,"]],[1035,["then by such useless brooding you will suffer a great deal,"]],[1039,["and the whole time that man will remain active within you."]],[1042,["Even though he may have forgotten the whole"]],[1045,["thing, and it may have left no effect upon him at all,"]],[1048,["you, by remembering that matter, will go on making"]],[1051,["yourself miserable again and again, and you will go on playing"]],[1054,["into his hands. And when we say, forgive everyone — to forgive"]],[1058,["everyone is the supreme instrument of a human being"]],[1061,["— then what is it that we actually do? This too is a very great"]],[1065,["falsehood, that we forgive — so what is it that we do?"]],[1068,["It is a myth. What do we do? You have told someone,"]],[1071,["\"I have forgiven you\" — what have you done?"]],[1073,["You have done nothing. You have only saved your own self, from the"]],[1077,["trouble of the other and from brooding upon the other."]],[1080,["As long as you keep dwelling painfully upon"]],[1083,["that man, you yourself will remain miserable."]],[1085,["Therefore, forgiveness is for us a very simple and straightforward instrument,"]],[1090,["by which we save ourselves from the torments of others."]],[1093,["This very great instrument lies within Jesus Christ."]],[1096,["Jesus Christ possesses those powers — as I have told you"]],[1099,["— within whom the eleven Rudras reside."]],[1101,["And yet He hung Himself upon the cross,"]],[1103,["He let Himself be hung upon it."]],[1105,["Why did He hang Himself upon the cross, when He had all the powers?"]],[1109,["He could have slain everyone and could have shattered everyone to pieces."]],[1112,["And right there, where the Adi Shakti, His own"]],[1115,["Mother, stood weeping beside Him — she could not bear"]],[1118,["it, because, after all, she was in a human birth. She could not bear it,"]],[1122,["that even though all the powers reside within me,"]],[1125,["these people are crucifying my child"]],[1127,["upon the cross, and that today I must stand here to witness this drama."]],[1132,["The truth of the matter is"]],[1134,["that such people neither"]],[1135,["endure any sorrow, nor become entangled in any pleasure; for them it is all"]],[1140,["a play and a drama. Coming into this world and mounting the"]],[1144,["cross, He showed what great fools these people are"]],[1147,["who crucified Him upon the cross."]],[1149,["That is why He used to ride upon a donkey, and the"]],[1152,["meaning of this is that His mount was always the donkey."]],[1156,["The direct corollary of this is that when you have a pain in your head,"]],[1161,["when there is very great trouble, very great suffering,"]],[1165,["then you should say, \"I have forgiven everyone.\""]],[1168,["Do not take any medicine, do not apply any treatment to it. Only say this,"]],[1173,["that all the people in the world, however many there are,"]],[1177,["who have tormented me or who go on tormenting me to this day —"]],[1181,["I have forgiven them all. You will see,"]],[1183,["your headache will go away. Especially"]],[1186,["for the Sahaja Yogis, who are"]],[1188,["kindled by this Kundalini Shakti,"]],[1190,["the work happens so quickly — because within you,"]],[1193,["Jesus Christ, who is the very embodiment of forgiveness, has been awakened."]],[1198,["Now see where His place is — it is upon the Agnya chakra. The Agnya chakra within us"]],[1204,["is at the optic chiasma,"]],[1205,["the place where the two nerves of our eyes cross each other;"]],[1209,["and there, in that very centre, is a point. It is so"]],[1213,["subtle even now that the doctors have not been able to see it. But there is"]],[1217,["an extremely subtle door at that place."]],[1220,["That is why He said, \"I am the door.\" This door is so"]],[1223,["exceedingly subtle that, in order to pass through it from within,"]],[1228,["a personality like Jesus Christ has to come into this world and pass through it."]],[1233,["Because of our ego, we killed Him —"]],[1235,["because we could not bear that a human being should come as God."]],[1239,["When some human being says, \"I am God,\" man cannot tolerate it, and that is why"]],[1245,["he killed Him. What wrong had He done?"]],[1247,["He did good to people the world over,"]],[1250,["He taught the whole world good things,"]],[1252,["He taught everyone to live with discipline,"]],[1255,["to live well, to put your life in proper order."]],[1259,["He kept to the language of love,"]],[1261,["and we gave Him malice and suffering and troubles."]],[1264,["But those who teach you filthy things and lead you into sinful deeds, and tell you"]],[1269,["to go on doing wicked things — that the more you do them, the"]],[1272,["better you will become — such people who make fools of you,"]],[1276,["we read their books day and night and keep going to their feet."]],[1279,["You have seen it today — in these times the gurus we follow"]],[1283,["are each more cunning and brazen than the other — are they not?"]],[1286,["For them we squander our money, for them we are ready to do anything in the world."]],[1291,["And if some such true man comes and stands before us, we crucify him."]],[1295,["To give such utterly foolish, egotistical people a very great lesson,"]],[1299,["to give them a mighty teaching,"]],[1300,["the Almighty God Himself sent His only begotten son into this world,"]],[1304,["and you nailed Him to the cross."]],[1306,["Just look at these specimens of your intelligence —"]],[1309,["what marvels you have achieved! And in this very way you have"]],[1312,["done it every single time."]],[1314,["Whenever any Incarnation came before, man went on doing exactly the same thing,"]],[1318,["and always ran away from the Truth — he kept clinging to"]],[1321,["what merely seemed good and"]],[1323,["kept fleeing from the True. Today I hear that people go to Shirdi a great deal."]],[1327,["Although Sainath has now departed from there,"]],[1329,["and they have made the place so filthy —"]],[1331,["even so, people keep going to Shirdi."]],[1333,["They go to Shirdi precisely because"]],[1335,["Sainath is not present here today."]],[1337,["When the Sainath of Shirdi was alive, He had nothing to eat."]],[1340,["Today everyone will go to Shirdi. Why? Because now that He is dead,"]],[1344,["all is well. Because now the Sainath of Shirdi"]],[1346,["has become tied around our necks!"]],[1348,["\"Our\" Sainath of Shirdi — since when did He become yours?"]],[1351,["This is the utter foolishness of man — to run after the one who has died."]],[1355,["It was for this very foolishness and this"]],[1357,["very ego that Jesus Christ sacrificed Himself."]],[1360,["And even today man goes on running — leaving aside the one who is before him,"]],[1364,["who is the living proof."]],[1366,["And he runs after such a one who has died, who is"]],[1368,["finished, and whose place today is somewhere else."]],[1371,["You have seen that many of the devotees of"]],[1373,["Shirdi who came here were asked to put the question —"]],[1376,["\"Shri Mataji, are You Shirdinath?\" —"]],[1378,["and the vibrations came within them. It is quite true."]],[1381,["Whenever any Incarnation came, if you had asked"]],[1384,["the question, you would have received the answer."]],[1386,["But you went on sitting with the one of the past"]],[1389,["who had died, and you went along leaning on him."]],[1391,["Because he is not alive today, it suits us well to have him in our hands."]],[1395,["For instance, I told you the story of Gyaneshwara — that here a very grand"]],[1399,["temple of Gyaneshwara has been built."]],[1401,["I said, \"Let us do contemplation here.\""]],[1403,["They said, \"No, sir, here you must do the dindi,"]],[1406,["here you must dance.\" I said, \"Did he do that?"]],[1408,["This idol that you have set up here before you — what did he do?\""]],[1412,["Then they began to say, \"His case was different; he was someone special.\""]],[1415,["I said, \"And you — born only for the dindi? He told you to contemplate"]],[1419,["even throughout this whole life,"]],[1421,["he told you to attain God."]],[1422,["The cause, the root cause of ignorance, is that there"]],[1425,["is no light within you — it is for this that he spoke;"]],[1428,["do that. Why should you do this?\""]],[1430,["\"No, no, Mataji, what You say is right, but this cannot be done here.\""]],[1433,["I said, \"If he were here today, I would speak with"]],[1436,["him — what is there for me to speak with you about?"]],[1439,["What a place I have come into,"]],[1440,["ending up with you.\" They did not let us contemplate, nor let us teach meditation,"]],[1445,["nor do anything — \"only do this.\""]],[1447,["So why does a human being cling to what is gone, to the past?"]],[1450,["Because of his ego. Because through it his ego is doubled —"]],[1453,["\"Brother, I am the disciple of so-and-so, of such-and-such.\""]],[1456,["But if you will not accept the living proof"]],[1458,["that stands right here before you,"]],[1460,["then how is your hunger ever going to be satisfied? What fulfilment is ever"]],[1464,["going to come to you? Just think about this —"]],[1467,["sometimes one should think of one's own interest,"]],[1470,["one should think of one's own welfare."]],[1472,["The Ganga is flowing here today, and you have gone off to sit somewhere"]],[1476,["where there is no Ganga, to fetch water from"]],[1478,["where the Ganga is not — and you say, \"Brother,"]],[1481,["I am sitting in the Ganga.\" This"]],[1482,["is the kind of talk you make."]],[1484,["The living proof that stands before you today — accept it."]],[1487,["The very same situation"]],[1489,["arose in the time of Jesus Christ."]],[1491,["He made many attempts at Kundalini awakening,"]],[1493,["but they remained so unsuccessful that He cured only twenty-one people in all —"]],[1498,["whereas now, in Sahaja Yoga, thousands of people are being cured."]],[1502,["He could have cured thousands, but the disciples He had were also great donkeys,"]],[1507,["also good for nothing. Those people only thought"]],[1510,["that Jesus Christ is a man who cures everything"]],[1513,["and does this healing — so, \"Come, bring this one to Him too,"]],[1516,["bring that one to Him as well.\" He said, \"Brother, no more than this.\" When they"]],[1521,["saw Him walking upon the water — because He is the Pranava, the Omkara,"]],[1525,["that is why He could walk upon the water,"]],[1527,["and the Kundalini too is the Omkara itself —"]],[1529,["even when they saw Him walking on the water,"]],[1532,["these people still did not believe in Him. With great difficulty"]],[1535,["He had gathered together barely twelve fishermen. And what else could He do?"]],[1540,["You hardly find anyone simpler than fishermen."]],[1542,["Just look at our own group here. In those days,"]],[1545,["twelve fishermen were found only with the greatest difficulty."]],[1548,["Nowadays, if you tried to explain the Kundalini to fishermen — how on earth!"]],[1552,["So you too can understand what those times"]],[1554,["were like — who was there to speak with Him?"]],[1557,["Nowadays people have become extremely"]],[1559,["intelligent; in those days they were of a very low order."]],[1562,["Somehow He explained it to them, He told"]],[1564,["them, yet they were not the kind to understand."]],[1566,["All they wanted was, \"You set this one right, set that one right.\""]],[1570,["Just as it happens in our Sahaja Yoga too — the moment some"]],[1573,["person is given realization, at once he will say, \"Mother,"]],[1576,["look, I have a sister, her husband has got such-and-such, will You cure him?\""]],[1580,["Then he comes back having taken a list of"]],[1582,["every sick person in the whole village."]],[1585,["Why? Because now they have become our agents."]],[1587,["Now they have taken up the agency. These too are all problems of the ego —"]],[1591,["all of them are problems of the ego."]],[1593,["A human being should understand that"]],[1595,["the ego is something very subtle."]],[1597,["Now, the other way is that you fight your own ego. That way too is not right."]],[1601,["By fighting the ego, you can never get anywhere."]],[1605,["The ego has to be absorbed within of its own accord."]],[1608,["When your attention, seated upon the Kundalini, piercing the Brahmarandhra,"]],[1613,["merges into that Virata,"]],[1615,["then the ego becomes a very part of that Virata. The ego that is in"]],[1619,["you people is false. What do you do? Ask"]],[1622,["yourselves — what do you do in this world?"]],[1625,["Why, you take some dead thing and give it another form —"]],[1629,["what great work is this that you do?"]],[1631,["Can you make a fruit out of a flower? First ask the question of yourself."]],[1635,["This nose, this mouth, this whole beautiful body and all"]],[1639,["else that you have been given — how did you come by it?"]],[1642,["You became a human being from an amoeba — how did that happen?"]],[1645,["With what beauty, without your even being aware of it, you were given all this."]],[1650,["It is the infinite, boundless grace of God that He created"]],[1653,["you and gave you this human form, this human embodiment."]],[1656,["Towards Him, what can a human being give but gratitude?"]],[1660,["Towards Him, what indeed can a human being give but reverence? What have you been"]],[1664,["doing till this day? What living work have you ever done?"]],[1667,["Take a test-tube baby — taking a living thing from somewhere,"]],[1670,["somehow nurturing and rearing that"]],[1672,["living thing and bringing it"]],[1674,["up — and over that the human being has become so full of ego! And that too —"]],[1678,["he who did not bring the living quality into being in the first place —"]],[1682,["he merely took the living quality from somewhere,"]],[1685,["just as we do a crossing, and crossed it in that way. How much ego the human"]],[1689,["being has acquired! He reached the moon,"]],[1691,["and how much ego he acquired! Before the One who made thousands"]],[1694,["of universes like this moon and this sun and"]],[1697,["set them in their places, what is your ego anyway?"]],[1700,["Your ego is false, but His ego is true."]],[1702,["That great Ego — \"Aham karoti,\" meaning,"]],[1704,["He exists, and it is He alone who does."]],[1706,["This is something I sometimes say in jest — that some people"]],[1709,["travelling in an aeroplane took their"]],[1712,["luggage up onto their own heads."]],[1713,["People asked them, \"Why have you put the luggage on your heads?\""]],[1717,["And they said, \"We are lightening the load of this aeroplane a little.\""]],[1721,["Your ego is just like that."]],[1723,["The ego you have is false."]],[1725,["You do nothing at all."]],[1726,["To this day you have done nothing at all."]],[1729,["Whatever you have done is all distorted."]],[1731,["Let Him do it who is the One to do it and who really does it."]],[1735,["You are only the instrument within His hands."]],[1738,["Just as this instrument stands here before"]],[1741,["Me today — it does nothing, this you know."]],[1743,["It is I who am speaking, I am speaking, and"]],[1746,["this one only stands in between as a witness."]],[1749,["He is being drawn along by this energy."]],[1751,["In the very same way, you too are an instrument of God. He has made you."]],[1755,["Let His power flow through you, and put your meaning, your purpose, to use."]],[1760,["And therefore, to put this meaning to use, upon the"]],[1763,["Agnya chakra — which is the most difficult chakra, the subtlest principle,"]],[1767,["that of the Omkara, of the Pranava —"]],[1770,["that very One descended in person into this world,"]],[1773,["and that very One in person is Shri Jesus Christ."]],[1776,["Now the Kundalini has a relationship with"]],[1779,["this just as the moon has with its moonlight,"]],[1782,["or the sun with its sun-rays."]],[1784,["The Kundalini, by her own power — Gauri, by her own power, created Shri Ganesha."]],[1789,["By her own strength of mind, by her own"]],[1792,["penance, by her own merit, she made Him into Ganesha."]],[1796,["When Ganesha had come to the stage where He could take incarnation,"]],[1800,["then Jesus Christ was born."]],[1802,["Now the people in England raise a great deal"]],[1805,["of argument about how He could have been born"]],[1808,["in this way — what they call divine conception —"]],[1811,["how can this be possible? I say,"]],[1813,["how little do these human beings understand,"]],[1816,["how little of all this do they really grasp!"]],[1819,["Do they ever even stop to think how a sprout breaks forth from a seed?"]],[1824,["How do you breathe? How does your movement,"]],[1827,["your functioning take place? Where does the energy in"]],[1830,["your brain come from? In what manner have you come into this world?"]],[1835,["Have you ever diagnosed any of this?"]],[1837,["You say that within the earth,"]],[1839,["in the depths of the ground,"]],[1841,["there is the force of gravity."]],[1843,["But just consider for a moment — where did it come from?"]],[1847,["Just as little children might suddenly imagine themselves to be Shivaji,"]],[1852,["in the same way these notions of human beings seem to me rather childish."]],[1857,["This power that seems to you to be active and working within yourselves —"]],[1862,["all this is maya, all this is illusion."]],[1864,["You have not yet known the Truth;"]],[1866,["you will have to break through this illusion."]],[1869,["Until this illusion of yours is broken, you will"]],[1872,["go on accepting this very illusion as the Truth."]],[1875,["And this is the great illusion within you — that it"]],[1878,["is you yourselves who are carrying out all the work."]],[1882,["And to break this illusion, it was necessary to bring a human form into the world."]],[1887,["For whenever, in this world, a human being or"]],[1889,["any other living creature has tried to take a step towards evolution,"]],[1894,["at that very time the Incarnations have come into the world."]],[1897,["You yourselves know that Vishnu took His Incarnation, and coming"]],[1901,["into the world as Shri Rama He"]],[1903,["wandered from forest to forest,"]],[1905,["and to make you understand, to bring a new dimension into your awareness —"]],[1910,["to show what an ideal king is like — He staged such a great drama."]],[1914,["In the same way was the life of Shri Krishna, and in the same way"]],[1918,["is the life of Jesus Christ."]],[1920,["But throughout the whole of their lives, if"]],[1923,["you look closely, only one thing stands out"]],[1926,["— and that is your foolishness, your supreme folly."]],[1930,["Because of which you sent so great"]],[1932,["a principle to the cross."]],[1934,["That is, the foolishness was exposed to such an extent,"]],[1938,["so tremendous was the folly that came to light, that"]],[1941,["at that time it was even said that if, in His place —"]],[1945,["if there is a thief, let the thief be crucified"]],[1948,["instead — that either the thief should be released or He."]],[1952,["So these Jews, who today consider themselves to be so very clever, they said, \"No,"]],[1957,["give Jesus Christ to the cross.\""]],[1959,["Today you know what the condition of these Jews"]],[1962,["is, in what wretchedness they have been trapped."]],[1966,["So great a sin have they committed from"]],[1968,["time immemorial — can it ever be washed away?"]],[1971,["Even now people remain caught in that very ego, caught in that very same ego,"]],[1976,["and even now they still think that the sinful deeds and the things they have done"]],[1981,["were some great act of merit. Even now,"]],[1983,["if they were to ask forgiveness from God —"]],[1986,["saying that we crucified Your very principle,"]],[1989,["we destroyed that great principle which was Yours, O Lord, forgive us —"]],[1993,["even now they could be forgiven. But for a human"]],[1996,["being, to ask for forgiveness is a very difficult thing. He goes on committing one"]],[2001,["wickedness after another."]],[2002,["Who is there in this world who can say that they welcomed the saints?"]],[2006,["Look at Nanak Sahib — how terribly he was"]],[2009,["tormented; look at Kabir — how he was persecuted."]],[2012,["No great person of this world has ever departed"]],[2015,["without suffering at the hands of this world,"]],[2017,["and those who inflict that suffering are human beings."]],[2021,["But now the world has changed, I am telling you. The Satya Yuga has begun."]],[2025,["You may try and see for yourselves — now no one"]],[2028,["can inflict suffering upon any saint or sage."]],[2031,["Enough has happened; now that is not going to go on any longer."]],[2035,["The reason is that Jesus Christ has"]],[2037,["set in motion a very great power into the"]],[2040,["world, so that now any wicked person, any tormentor,"]],[2043,["may be taught a lesson. His Ekadasha Rudras have today become fully armed and ready."]],[2048,["And whoever tries to torment any saint or sage will be utterly destroyed."]],[2052,["To try to torment any saint or sage — this is a great sin. This you must understand,"]],[2058,["and from the example of Jesus Christ you must learn,"]],[2061,["so that we do not commit this folly again."]],[2063,["If we commit this folly, then we will have failed, and we will be finished forever."]],[2068,["Now, if any man calls himself an Incarnation, he"]],[2070,["should not be accepted as an Incarnation — this is certain. If every single man says"]],[2075,["\"I am an Incarnation, I am an Incarnation,\" he"]],[2078,["must not be believed. In our own scriptures the criteria are laid down;"]],[2081,["looking at those criteria, if that Incarnation is proved genuine,"]],[2085,["then he should be accepted."]],[2086,["Someone brought me the news that Jesus Christ had been born again."]],[2090,["I said, \"Oh really, where did this happen?\" They said, \"He is in Rome.\""]],[2094,["I said, \"I see, and what does he do?\" They said, \"He says, 'I am Jesus Christ.'\""]],[2098,["So I said, \"In that way even a donkey can say so."]],[2101,["Saying so hardly makes him Jesus Christ.\" They said,"]],[2104,["\"What is the mark of Jesus Christ?\""]],[2106,["I said, \"Tell him to walk on water."]],[2108,["Tell him now to stop the wind, the water, the storm."]],[2111,["If he can stop them, and if he can walk on"]],[2113,["water, and if he can bring the dead back to life, then he is Jesus Christ."]],[2117,["If he cannot do this, then he is not Jesus Christ.\""]],[2120,["Then they said that this man does not do any such thing at all."]],[2123,["Later it came to be known that he ran away"]],[2126,["after taking a great deal of money from people."]],[2128,["The greatest lesson we can learn from the life of Jesus Christ is this:"]],[2132,["that you remain just as you have been placed."]],[2135,["Jesus Christ never changed His profession."]],[2137,["He did not go about advertising to"]],[2139,["the world that \"I am a renunciate.\" He even went to a wedding."]],[2143,["He went to the wedding, and once there He arranged everything."]],[2146,["Now, regarding that wedding it is written that He made wine from water."]],[2150,["And human beings have seized upon this point, saying, \"Why, the man made liquor!\""]],[2155,["The meaning of \"wine\" — even today if you go to Israel,"]],[2158,["or in the Hebrew language —"]],[2159,["is the juice of the grape; it is not liquor."]],[2162,["It was only later that someone's clever mind got to"]],[2165,["work, thinking it should be fermented and made into liquor."]],[2168,["And regarding this, if you read the life of"]],[2170,["Moses, then Moses has said in very clear words"]],[2173,["that alcohol and strong substances"]],[2175,["of this kind should not be taken by human beings at all."]],[2178,["The reason is what I told you the other day"]],[2181,["in connection with the Guru principle —"]],[2183,["that Moses is a very great Guru principle."]],[2186,["All those who have been Gurus —"]],[2188,["because their work is upon the Nabhi chakra"]],[2191,["and they reside around the Nabhi,"]],[2193,["in the place where the Void is they dwell, and because that has its effect"]],[2197,["upon the liver —"]],[2199,["that is why every Guru, whether it be Nanak, or whether it be Kabir,"]],[2203,["or whether it be your Moses, Abraham, or Socrates,"]],[2206,["all of them forbade liquor."]],[2207,["Because this is their principle. Each one does the work"]],[2211,["that is his to do. The work of the Gurus is to establish you in"]],[2214,["Dharma, and that is why they forbade liquor."]],[2217,["And those whose work is different — as, for instance, the work of Jesus Christ,"]],[2221,["which was to open your Agnya chakra, to break your ego — that work He performed."]],[2226,["The work that is mine, I have to do: to awaken"]],[2228,["your Kundalini and to break open your Kundalini into the Sahasrara."]],[2232,["But because this is the work of integration, of the whole,"]],[2235,["I have to speak about every one of them."]],[2237,["I have to speak about Jesus Christ, I have to"]],[2240,["speak about Nanak, I have to speak about Janaka,"]],[2242,["and in the same way I have to speak about Rama, Krishna, and so on"]],[2246,["— about all the Incarnations that have ever come into the world —"]],[2249,["and about Shiva and the rest, all the powers"]],[2251,["that are within us; I have to speak about them all."]],[2254,["Because today is the time of completeness, of wholeness, and so"]],[2257,["it is of this wholeness that we must speak. Yet even in this, you will see —"]],[2261,["and you will be surprised — that Sahaja Yoga is found mostly in the cities;"]],[2265,["in the villages it is not so."]],[2267,["It is in the cities that it spreads, slowly, little by little. For to find the Truth"]],[2271,["and to receive the Truth is not within the"]],[2274,["power of the human being. This you have seen"]],[2276,["from history itself. And even today,"]],[2278,["where is the human being going to change? He is in the very"]],[2281,["same condition. The only difference is that the human being of today is so"]],[2285,["scattered, so distracted and absent-minded, as he has never been before."]],[2289,["And this is why it was said that this work would come to pass only in the Kali Yuga."]],[2294,["In the tale of Nala and Damayanti, once Nala caught Kali, and Kali said, \"Brother,"]],[2299,["if you wish to kill me, then kill me;"]],[2302,["but first hear my glory, hear my greatness."]],[2305,["There is a special power in me — hear it.\""]],[2307,["So Nala asked, \"What is your greatness, Kali?\""]],[2310,["Kali replied: \"My greatness is that the"]],[2312,["great saints and ascetics in the mountain caves"]],[2315,["will attain this realization in very great numbers;"]],[2319,["and all the justice, all the judgement, will take place in the Kali Yuga.\""]],[2323,["Sahaja Yoga itself is this last judgement;"]],[2325,["this is what the Bible calls the last judgement of the Truth."]],[2329,["It is only after coming into Sahaja Yoga that you"]],[2332,["are judged — whether you stand firm upon it or not."]],[2335,["But one must remain steady upon it, or he will be sold away."]],[2338,["For even after attaining the Truth, it is"]],[2341,["difficult for the human being to hold fast to it."]],[2343,["Many people ask me, \"Mother, when did we become steady?\""]],[2347,["This is just like asking: you have come out of the water and stepped into the boat."]],[2351,["Well, when did you become steady?"]],[2353,["When you felt that you had become steady. When you are riding a bicycle,"]],[2357,["at the very beginning you wobble —"]],[2359,["so when did you become steady? When you felt that you had become steady."]],[2363,["This is for you yourself to judge — whether you have become steady or not."]],[2367,["And when you become steady, Nirvikalpa becomes established within you."]],[2371,["Until the moment our Kundalini descends below the Agnya chakra,"]],[2375,["we cannot come into thoughtlessness. That first abode of Samadhi —"]],[2379,["Nirvichara, thoughtless awareness — does not become established."]],[2382,["As soon as the Kundalini crosses over this Agnya chakra — that is,"]],[2386,["through the door which Shri Jesus Christ opened for"]],[2389,["us, where it is by taking the very name of Shri Jesus Christ,"]],[2393,["by saying His Lord's Prayer, that the Agnya chakra opens — and after it has opened,"]],[2398,["we enter into the realm of thoughtless"]],[2400,["awareness, into what we may call the destination,"]],[2403,["the Kingdom of God, which is the limbic area in our brain,"]],[2407,["in which all these seven chakras and the sub-chakras as well are seated."]],[2411,["Until the human being reaches that state,"]],[2414,["thoughtless awareness too does not"]],[2416,["become established within him."]],[2418,["The greatest cause of the Agnya chakra going out of order is the eyes."]],[2422,["The human being must guard his eyes very carefully."]],[2426,["The eye is a tremendously important thing."]],[2428,["The bowing of the forehead — this is why Shri Jesus"]],[2432,["Christ said, \"Do not bow your forehead before anyone.\""]],[2435,["Because to bow your forehead before just anyone means"]],[2437,["that you do not know before whom you are about to lose all that you have earned;"]],[2442,["you do not know before what thief you may be bowing"]],[2445,["down your forehead. This is why He said,"]],[2447,["\"Do not bow your forehead before anyone.\""]],[2449,["You know that in Sahaja Yoga too, I always say: since I have given you nothing,"]],[2453,["why do you come to My Feet?"]],[2455,["But here in our Maharashtra especially, there is a great"]],[2458,["malady of seeking darshan. And just try telling people otherwise."]],[2462,["Once we went to a certain village where"]],[2464,["there were about five or six thousand people."]],[2466,["So I said, \"Baba, if so many people come to the Feet, it will take a very long time."]],[2471,["So do not come to the Feet,"]],[2472,["do not take this darshan.\""]],[2474,["And everyone became sulky —"]],[2475,["\"Mataji, why have You become displeased with us?"]],[2478,["Why are You not letting us come to Your Feet?\""]],[2481,["One should bow one's forehead only before that person"]],[2484,["who is the very representative of God Himself. One should not bow one's"]],[2487,["forehead before just any worthless, good-for-nothing person."]],[2491,["This is a very important matter. The moment you bow your"]],[2494,["forehead in the wrong place,"]],[2496,["your forehead is turned the wrong way."]],[2498,["And it is for this reason, you know, that most"]],[2501,["people nowadays have a spoiled Agnya chakra."]],[2504,["If your forehead has not bowed before the great teachers,"]],[2507,["has not bowed before great souls, but instead has bowed"]],[2510,["in a place where there are wrong people,"]],[2513,["where there is some false guru, then the Agnya chakra becomes spoiled."]],[2517,["Of all the diseases that afflict the eyes, very many of them arise for this reason —"]],[2523,["because we do not look after the principle of our Agnya chakra."]],[2527,["The main principle of the Agnya chakra is that the"]],[2531,["human being should read only the most pure things."]],[2534,["Whatever is impure should not be read."]],[2537,["People say, \"What is the harm in it? We went"]],[2540,["there; now we have to talk with all sorts of people,"]],[2543,["our line of work is such\" — but then your eyes too will be spoiled."]],[2547,["Why do you read the very things that spoil your eyes?"]],[2550,["By looking at wrong people too, your eyes become spoiled."]],[2554,["Yesterday I told you that Shri"]],[2556,["Jesus Christ said one thing —"]],[2557,["He said to you, \"Thou shalt not commit adultery, but I tell you,"]],[2561,["thou shalt not have adulterous eyes.\" He said this with great emphasis:"]],[2565,["that if there is adultery in your eye, then your eyes will grow weak."]],[2570,["This does not mean that if you wear spectacles you are a wrong person."]],[2573,["After a certain age one has to wear spectacles anyway; that is simply a law of life."]],[2578,["But there are very many causes for the eyes being spoiled, and this is one of them."]],[2582,["Now there are many people whose attention"]],[2585,["is utterly distracted all the time, running about this way and that;"]],[2588,["they cannot keep their eyes steady even"]],[2590,["for a single minute, the whole time the eyes keep"]],[2593,["darting here and there. And they themselves do not even"]],[2596,["realize why they are rolling their eyes about —"]],[2599,["again and again they will look this way and that."]],[2601,["God alone knows what they are looking at."]],[2604,["The greatest effect upon the eyes comes from the way in which you work."]],[2607,["Suppose you over-work, you are extremely"]],[2610,["engrossed in your work, you do it to excess."]],[2612,["Even though you may be doing good work — not bad work, not impure work —"]],[2616,["though it is not exactly impure and not exactly pure either, it is a kind of neutral"]],[2621,["work that you are doing. But even so,"]],[2623,["if you work a great deal, if you read a great deal,"]],[2625,["if you sew a great deal, if you read aloud and recite a great deal,"]],[2629,["and if you think a great deal,"]],[2631,["then too your eyes become spoilt."]],[2632,["The reason for this is that when you work to excess, you forget God."]],[2636,["Your devotion to God, your communion with Him,"]],[2638,["is no longer settled within you."]],[2640,["You forget Jesus Christ."]],[2642,["He was not educated; He had not read even a"]],[2644,["single letter, He never went to any school,"]],[2646,["He never went to any college, nor had He ever seen any teacher."]],[2650,["Yet today universities have been opened in His name,"]],[2652,["great theological colleges have been built in His name,"]],[2655,["and there, by making themselves professors in those"]],[2658,["theological colleges, people have built great big churches."]],[2661,["And in those very churches all this goes on"]],[2664,["— to my mind, all of them ought to be called"]],[2666,["jokers; to me they seem nothing but jokers."]],[2669,["Because a man who is a graduate of God is all right, but those who have done no"]],[2673,["such graduation at all, who have received no initiation whatsoever from God,"]],[2677,["set up all their grand pomp and show among themselves and think, \"Ah,"]],[2681,["how great we are!\" and they walk about so very seriously."]],[2684,["These are great foolish jokers. When you"]],[2686,["have not yet even received Self-realization, when not even the line of true"]],[2691,["knowledge has yet appeared within you,"]],[2693,["when not even the light has yet come within you,"]],[2696,["then why do you carry on this kind of pretence and humbug?"]],[2699,["You go about putting on airs as though you were some very great saint."]],[2703,["And there are elections held in it."]],[2706,["You have just been reading about the election of the Pope."]],[2709,["When one sees all the pretence and humbug that goes on in this world,"]],[2713,["a human being like me feels: O God,"]],[2715,["will they ever be able to understand Jesus Christ or not?"]],[2718,["First they crucified Him, and now today they are making a mockery of Him,"]],[2722,["they are turning Him into a farce."]],[2724,["Among us too there are many such men who"]],[2726,["go about posing as Shankaracharyas — among us too there are"]],[2730,["these great big ones. Nowadays I have heard that"]],[2732,["one Shankaracharya is having"]],[2734,["a golden crown made for himself and an enormous golden"]],[2737,["ceremonial umbrella made,"]],[2738,["because he thought that since the Pope has one, we ought to have one too."]],[2742,["May such an umbrella fall upon his head with such a thud"]],[2746,["that all these Shankaracharyas will be put in their place!"]],[2749,["The original Adi Shankaracharya did not have"]],[2752,["even enough money to cremate his own mother's body,"]],[2755,["and today these Shankaracharyas are piling up their properties, hoarding up money."]],[2760,["And we, who consider ourselves so very clever, and"]],[2763,["who have been initiated by such a Shankaracharya —"]],[2766,["today we are the ones filling the bellies of these people."]],[2769,["Tell me, where does Kundalini come into all this?"]],[2773,["The Kundalini is something utterly pure and true."]],[2776,["It is not humbug or the running of some shop; it is the absolute Truth."]],[2781,["And you cannot gauge this Truth until you yourself descend into the Truth."]],[2785,["You cannot measure it from the outside."]],[2788,["To attain it, you yourself will have to achieve identity with the Truth,"]],[2793,["you will have to bring about oneness with the Truth."]],[2796,["When you become one with the Truth, then you"]],[2799,["will know that this is the supreme Truth — that you"]],[2802,["are an instrument of that Supreme Father, that God"]],[2806,["Almighty, through whom this energy is going to flow."]],[2809,["And from within this you are an instrument of"]],[2812,["that energy, of that power, of that power of love, through whom the power"]],[2817,["of love is going to be transmitted throughout"]],[2820,["the whole world. But how great is the sacrifice"]],[2823,["of Jesus Christ in this, by which He opened our Agnya chakra for us!"]],[2827,["If the Agnya chakra is not all right, the Kundalini will simply not rise."]],[2832,["If a person's Agnya chakra is caught, then"]],[2835,["his Mooladhara is bound to be caught as well,"]],[2838,["and that Kundalini will simply not rise."]],[2841,["If the Agnya chakra is caught, then that Kundalini will not rise by any means."]],[2846,["When there is a catch on the Agnya chakra, then for that we apply sindoor upon it,"]],[2852,["we apply kumkum. People ask me, \"Mother,"]],[2854,["why do You apply kumkum?\" Especially abroad people say, \"Why,"]],[2858,["You are turning us all into Hindus.\""]],[2861,["I said, I am turning everyone into Christians. This is the very blood of"]],[2866,["Jesus Christ that I am applying to everyone,"]],[2869,["so that you may remember Him, by which your ego may be removed"]],[2873,["and all your afflictions may be taken away."]],[2876,["It is only when that sindoor is applied that"]],[2879,["the Agnya chakra opens and the Kundalini goes up."]],[2882,["Such is the connection between the Kundalini and this great Incarnation."]],[2886,["Because Shri Sakshat Ganesha, who sits at one station guarding His own chastity,"]],[2891,["He Himself comes upon the Agnya chakra and opens its passage and opens the door."]],[2896,["What should we do for this chakra?"]],[2898,["What should we do to set this chakra right?"]],[2900,["For this there are many ways. As I have said,"]],[2903,["one should improve one's manner of working. For a man who works"]],[2907,["far too much — you know that he develops a disease like diabetes,"]],[2911,["by which the eyes too become very weak."]],[2913,["One should reform one's manner of working a little."]],[2916,["Of course one must work, but there is so much"]],[2918,["imbalance in society that one poor"]],[2920,["man works himself to death,"]],[2921,["while another man does no work at all."]],[2924,["This imbalance cannot be set right by God; it is human"]],[2926,["beings who can set it right — that everyone should work, so that all may share"]],[2931,["the burden of the work. It should not be that one man's eyes give out,"]],[2934,["that he becomes utterly weak,"]],[2936,["that he gets diabetes, that he dies at a very early age,"]],[2939,["that he gets a heart attack, while other men lie about in sheer idleness."]],[2943,["Therefore this balance of society"]],[2945,["must come into the human being,"]],[2947,["and the human being must understand that through any"]],[2950,["one excess whatsoever, society itself becomes corrupted."]],[2954,["Therefore it is not fitting that you should remain in any such excess."]],[2958,["Improving your manner of working means that you"]],[2961,["should also relax your eyes for a little while."]],[2964,["And for that there are many arrangements in"]],[2966,["Sahaja Yoga — how the eyes are to be relaxed,"]],[2969,["how one bathes one's eyes in light and in the sun. First, of course,"]],[2973,["realization must definitely take place;"]],[2976,["after that, we can learn how we may set our eyes right,"]],[2980,["how we may take the burden off them, how we may relax them."]],[2984,["There are many such methods by which you can put your eyes right,"]],[2989,["and by which you can also keep your Agnya chakra in good order."]],[2993,["But the very best thing is that you keep an eye upon your own ego and talk to it."]],[2998,["Say to it, \"Well now, so you have got into your ego?"]],[3002,["Now, Your Majesty, where are you off to? What is on your mind?"]],[3006,["What do you want to do in your ego?\""]],[3008,["In this way go on addressing your own self."]],[3011,["Look at yourself in the mirror and say,"]],[3014,["\"Well, well, how wonderful you are!"]],[3016,["You think yourself a very great man.\""]],[3018,["If in this way you converse with your ego, then if there is any"]],[3022,["pressure on the eyes because of the ego,"]],[3025,["that too will be removed. Now the other side, the back side of the Agnya chakra,"]],[3030,["which we may call the hinder part of Jesus Christ, or which is called Mahaganesha."]],[3036,["For when Shri Ganesha became Mahaganesha, then He came"]],[3040,["as Jesus Christ; and Jesus Christ is in the very centre,"]],[3044,["and around Him these eleven Rudras"]],[3046,["are under His dominion."]],[3047,["These eleven Rudras of His — among whom are"]],[3050,["Mahaganesha and Shadanana and the others —"]],[3053,["these eleven Rudras are all around Him."]],[3056,["Now, the moment you close your eyes"]],[3058,["and the Kundalini rises, you cannot see what is happening inside."]],[3063,["But if you keep your eyes open, then for a"]],[3065,["minute you may feel that your eyes are dilating, and a sudden darkness"]],[3070,["comes before you, because the dilation of the"]],[3073,["pupil has taken place. When your Kundalini rises within,"]],[3077,["a dilatation of the pupil takes place and the pupils relax, and this is the work of"]],[3082,["the parasympathetic. You can observe this even after realization."]],[3086,["If a person's Kundalini has not yet pierced the Brahmarandhra,"]],[3089,["and you look at his pupils, they appear very large and very dark."]],[3093,["But once the Kundalini has pierced through,"]],[3096,["a certain shine comes into the eyes."]],[3098,["Such a person's eyes are always shining."]],[3100,["Even if he grows old, still his eyes keep shining."]],[3103,["And in this way you can recognize whether a person is realized or not."]],[3107,["How do you recognize the eyes of demons? The eyes of demons were"]],[3110,["like a cat's eyes. Whether you have ever seen a cat's eyes or not,"]],[3114,["I do not know. But in a cat's eye, that white part — the retina — keeps shrinking,"]],[3119,["and the pupil in the middle becomes very tiny and suddenly vanishes altogether."]],[3124,["If a demon allows you to look into his eyes for a little while —"]],[3128,["because these demonic people come so well"]],[3130,["disguised that you cannot recognize them —"]],[3133,["but if you go to many of these"]],[3135,["gurus and look into their eyes, you will see this in them:"]],[3138,["that within a short while their eyes"]],[3141,["suddenly vanish inward. Mostly they avoid your eyes."]],[3143,["But if your eyes do meet theirs, you can see"]],[3146,["that, just like a cat's, their eyes suddenly"]],[3148,["roll inward in a flash."]],[3150,["This is the way to recognize them. Because the principle"]],[3153,["of Jesus Christ is not there. Jesus Christ is not awakened in them."]],[3157,["There, the most loathsome kind of"]],[3159,["thoughts and dark plotting go on. And for this reason they"]],[3162,["are afraid of you. There will be many such people that if"]],[3165,["you touch them they get a short circuit and collapse flat"]],[3168,["to the ground. There are many such evil spirits roaming about in this world"]],[3172,["who call themselves gurus."]],[3174,["If you go to garland them, they will throw the"]],[3176,["garland back at you; they will not let you touch them;"]],[3179,["they cannot even wear your garland —"]],[3181,["so low is the level of these people,"]],[3183,["they get a short circuit."]],[3185,["Now, these are deep matters and subtle matters, which you will understand later."]],[3189,["But what we were just speaking about, regarding"]],[3192,["Jesus Christ, is this: that by contemplating on Him,"]],[3195,["by thinking of Him, our Agnya chakra can be set right."]],[3198,["But not the kind of contemplation devised by"]],[3200,["those who have built such inauspicious systems around Him."]],[3204,["If you look around, they depict Jesus Christ"]],[3207,["as thin, frail, sickly — as if, I do not know,"]],[3210,["they had picked up some TB patient from somewhere. Is this any way to make a"]],[3215,["picture of Jesus Christ? In my view, the painter himself must be sickly like this,"]],[3220,["and that is why he makes such pictures of Him"]],[3223,["and hangs them up, looking wretched and miserable."]],[3226,["He was extremely strong, He was a very"]],[3228,["radiant Personality, and so beautiful to look at,"]],[3232,["and there was such brilliance within Him,"]],[3234,["and He was a very robust, well-built man."]],[3237,["He was neither very tall nor very short, but a fine man of ordinary height."]],[3242,["A man who could lift such a huge cross with His own hands and carry it —"]],[3247,["could He be such a frail, sickly man? The kind of pictures people"]],[3251,["make and circulate, whose photographs are sold"]],[3254,["all over the world, and people think — wow, wow, wow!"]],[3257,["What a picture they have made of Jesus Christ! This is an utter"]],[3262,["insult to Him. Only one great artist, by the name of Rubens,"]],[3266,["whose home I myself have visited — there I saw the very famous"]],[3270,["painting of Jesus Christ called the Ascent"]],[3273,["and Descent of Christ — he has brought out this matter very beautifully,"]],[3278,["and has portrayed Jesus Christ as an extremely"]],[3281,["robust and very joyful being."]],[3283,["Because nowadays, all over the world,"]],[3285,["only the bony type — tall, broad-framed,"]],[3287,["very lanky girls — are considered beautiful. Absolutely bony!"]],[3290,["If small children were to see them,"]],[3292,["they would feel like vomiting at the sight."]],[3295,["On top of that she comes wearing heels,"]],[3297,["and she gets the first prize in beauty. Extremely tall,"]],[3300,["utterly thin and frail, as though she will fall"]],[3303,["down or die any moment — and even so she comes walking on heels."]],[3306,["If little children saw her they would say — good heavens!"]],[3309,["Who dragged this thing from a spider's web?"]],[3311,["But the modern ideas of today have become so"]],[3314,["perverted that we have a taste for looking"]],[3317,["at such spider's webs."]],[3318,["Because we ourselves are caught in a spider's web,"]],[3321,["the spider's webs appeal to us."]],[3323,["What was beauty like in the earlier days — when Leonardo da Vinci lived,"]],[3328,["whose painting the whole world reveres today."]],[3330,["Look at the painting of the Mona Lisa —"]],[3333,["a robust, well-built woman."]],[3335,["There is the utmost grace within her, and the atmosphere about her is utterly pure."]],[3340,["And the whole world will come to see her,"]],[3342,["yet when they give the first prize, it goes to these six-foot-seven women"]],[3346,["who come walking there wearing such high heels, sickly and frail,"]],[3349,["looking as if they died yesterday or will die today —"]],[3352,["this is their condition, and people regard this as beauty."]],[3356,["The very imagination of man has been distorted along with his own perversion."]],[3360,["And once we have accepted such people as our ideals,"]],[3363,["then day and night women are busy with this one pursuit —"]],[3366,["how can we too take on this spider-web, skeletal condition? And"]],[3370,["for that they will toil, and run about, and do all these things."]],[3374,["In reality, such women are a great headache."]],[3376,["The man into whose lap one of them falls comes to know it well."]],[3380,["There is no sweetness in them, no tenderness of any kind,"]],[3384,["no capacity to bear with anything,"]],[3386,["nor can they give love to their children."]],[3389,["But such perverted ideas enter into us,"]],[3391,["and by constantly looking at such women, the sense of beauty within us"]],[3395,["becomes so utterly corrupted."]],[3397,["Now it may seem to you that Mataji is talking of very old, outdated things,"]],[3401,["but what I am telling you are eternal truths —"]],[3403,["that you cast an impure glance upon every woman on the road."]],[3406,["Even upon a single woman,"]],[3408,["this is a great sin. So think how many sinful deeds you commit"]],[3411,["day and night walking along the street. I am telling you in"]],[3414,["the relationship of a Mother that you should give"]],[3417,["up all these pursuits. These are all worthless"]],[3419,["things. There is no gain whatsoever in doing all this."]],[3422,["Jesus Christ told it two thousand years ago,"]],[3424,["but today I am saying that the poor"]],[3426,["One could not explain it so openly. Whatever He said,"]],[3429,["He said with great force. But you took Him up and put Him upon the cross."]],[3433,["For one thing, you cannot crucify me — that is the first point; and secondly,"]],[3437,["I am clever enough that I will tell you in such"]],[3440,["a way that it will get right into your skull."]],[3443,["Because He had not explained what happens when you do this deed."]],[3446,["He only said — do not do this, it is a filthy thing."]],[3449,["Adulterous eyes are very, very much against your being."]],[3452,["But He did not say what happens by keeping adulterous eyes,"]],[3455,["what its evil consequences are."]],[3457,["Day and night this very thought runs about in our minds."]],[3461,["And by doing this, what will you save yourself from?"]],[3464,["Are you a human being at all?"]],[3465,["You will become worse than an animal, worse even than the beasts."]],[3469,["That is why in our Yoga Shastra it is said that one must"]],[3473,["restrain the tendencies of one's attention — check it,"]],[3476,["check it, keep it upon the right path. One should keep it bowed"]],[3479,["in humility before God, and one should walk in that direction."]],[3483,["We are built upon Yoga; ours is the land of Yoga."]],[3486,["We are not egoists, nor are we meant to be. Those who wish to make"]],[3490,["themselves egoists may take their immigration"]],[3493,["and go off to England. They have no need to live here,"]],[3496,["and no need to spoil this country either."]],[3499,["We are not to indulge in egoism."]],[3501,["We are to live here in the manner of the Land of Yoga."]],[3504,["And a day will come when"]],[3506,["we shall attain our Yoga,"]],[3507,["and when we receive the fruit of our holy"]],[3510,["land, then the whole world will be at your feet. On that day they will know where"]],[3515,["Jesus Christ truly belonged, and on that day they"]],[3518,["will know where Jesus Christ has actually been received and honoured."]],[3523,["Even today, in our land of India, woman is held in"]],[3526,["great respect; the womankind is held in great respect."]],[3530,["Even today the mother is regarded as a"]],[3532,["mother and the sister is regarded as a sister."]],[3535,["They will come here and understand that Jesus Christ"]],[3539,["is most honoured and most followed in this country,"]],[3542,["and not in those countries that go about calling themselves Christian Nations."]],[3546,["Whatever has to be told to you is so very much that — as you know —"]],[3551,["I have said that a book of five hundred pages has been written,"]],[3554,["and in it this boy sent I do not know how many pages on Jesus Christ."]],[3559,["Because he was a Catholic by community, he has given a good deal of thought to that."]],[3564,["And he himself had earlier gone off somewhere to become a priest."]],[3568,["And in this way he made a great investigation into all these matters."]],[3572,["And when he understood that Jesus Christ dwells"]],[3575,["within our very own selves and is within us —"]],[3578,["And until we are reborn... Jesus Christ has said that you have to be born again."]],[3583,["This second birth comes only through the path of the Kundalini."]],[3588,["And until the Kundalini is awakened, you cannot be born again."]],[3591,["Until your second birth takes place, you will not know God. Read the Bible afresh —"]],[3596,["read it after you have got your realization —"]],[3599,["and you will be amazed that in all of it"]],[3601,["Jesus Christ has done nothing but sing the glory of Sahaja Yoga."]],[3605,["Each and every word of His is such that we take it to heart."]],[3609,["But those who have no eyes cannot understand it."]],[3612,["They even mock at it and speak false things about it."]],[3615,["Now here He said a profound thing — that I am"]],[3618,["the path, I am the door, that I am the door,"]],[3620,["I am the path. The meaning of this is that He"]],[3623,["is the path and He is the door — quite right,"]],[3625,["for the path passes through the door."]],[3628,["Now the meaning given to it became that He is the only one — they clung to that,"]],[3632,["that after Him there can be no one else. And who are these people who"]],[3636,["depend on that idea? These people who have set themselves"]],[3639,["up as clowns posing as Christians."]],[3641,["Any man comes along and gives you baptism."]],[3644,["To give baptism is in fact"]],[3645,["to break open your Sahasrara."]],[3647,["To break open the Sahasrara and to draw the Kundalini out"]],[3651,["through it and grant realization — that alone is baptism."]],[3654,["That is to say, the very final act of the Kundalini is baptism."]],[3658,["And these people who keep giving you baptism in the church —"]],[3661,["what authority do they have to give baptism?"]],[3664,["They are merely attempting something to which they have no right."]],[3668,["And otherwise, they have now started philanthropic work."]],[3671,["Philanthropic work — well, come on, brother, serve the poor, serve them."]],[3676,["Now you will say — Mataji, but this is a good work."]],[3679,["It is good, yes, but this is not God's work, this is man's work."]],[3683,["You made them poor, you made them miserable,"]],[3686,["and now you are to set them right?"]],[3689,["God's work is not to go and serve the poor, and first to manufacture poverty"]],[3694,["and then to serve the poor."]],[3696,["God's work is to take you into the Kingdom of God,"]],[3699,["to unite you with God; to fill you completely"]],[3703,["with His joy, His grace, His peace, His splendour. That is God's work."]],[3706,["It is not that a man steals, cheats, tells lies, and roams about all over"]],[3710,["the world crying 'I am poor, I am poor,' and you go and kiss his feet."]],[3714,["This philanthropic work is the work of human beings,"]],[3717,["and we must understand this fully and completely."]],[3720,["I asked, \"Tell me, are these Christian people doing any philanthropic work?\""]],[3724,["Wherever they went, they went only to make people Christians."]],[3727,["Wherever tribal people were sitting,"]],[3729,["they reached there to do philanthropic work"]],[3732,["— and they make everyone a Christian."]],[3734,["Whatever you turn a donkey into —"]],[3736,["make him a Christian or make him a Muslim —"]],[3738,["the donkey will still remain a donkey."]],[3741,["Just by changing that label on him,"]],[3743,["do you think it is going to make any difference?"]],[3745,["But these fools think that through this their democracy grows."]],[3749,["These people have turned it into politics."]],[3752,["Whatever it may be, ask them directly —"]],[3754,["why do you do philanthropy?"]],[3755,["And the quotation from the Bible that they gave in answer is very amusing,"]],[3760,["and when you see it you will realize how foolish those people were."]],[3763,["They said that Mary Magdalene bought an oil — a very expensive oil —"]],[3767,["and she brought it,"]],[3768,["and she began to say to Jesus Christ that \"I wish to anoint Your body with this.\""]],[3772,["Then Judas said, \"Brother, why are you wasting such expensive oil on His body?"]],[3776,["It could be sold and given to the poor."]],[3778,["He was the philanthropic one!"]],[3780,["And it was he who, in the end, had Jesus Christ handed over."]],[3783,["And even those thirty pieces of silver that he"]],[3785,["received, those too he distributed among the poor."]],[3788,["It is just like the way so many people do"]],[3790,["black marketing — they do black marketing here —"]],[3793,["and then they go and stand before the"]],[3795,["temple and distribute loaves of bread,"]],[3797,["or they go and give money to some sadhu or baba."]],[3800,["And in this way they console their own soul —"]],[3802,["\"Well, brother, we did a little black marketing,"]],[3805,["but at least we have also done a little philanthropic work,"]],[3808,["a little meritorious deed.\" In the very same way,"]],[3811,["he said that whatever there is,"]],[3812,["give it to the poor people — this is what Mr. Judas said."]],[3816,["So Jesus Christ at that moment gave this reply: \"These poor are for ever,"]],[3820,["but I am for a short time.\" The meaning is"]],[3823,["that this divine life has come for a short time. Look at that,"]],[3827,["that is what has importance."]],[3829,["These poor are an everlasting headache anyway."]],[3832,["And about very rich people too He had said that \"It is easy for a camel to"]],[3837,["pass through the eye of a needle,"]],[3839,["but it is an impossibility for a rich man to enter"]],[3842,["into the kingdom of God.\" These two extremes He pointed"]],[3846,["out throughout His life. You must put an end to"]],[3849,["both of these extremes. And the Christian people —"]],[3852,["they are either at this extreme, or at that extreme. Now this philanthropic work —"]],[3857,["here too many people, after seeing Him,"]],[3859,["set up missions. And the people who come through these"]],[3863,["missions do not get realization."]],[3865,["They say, \"Mother, we do so much mission work.\" Yes, do it!"]],[3868,["Do it officially, do it privately."]],[3871,["You may call it a public service, it is good for everyone."]],[3874,["Yes, there are many names for it too — call it social work."]],[3878,["But this is not the work of God."]],[3880,["There is no need for any misappropriation."]],[3883,["The work of God flows unobstructed."]],[3885,["Just as people will say, \"Mother, You too cure people's illnesses.\""]],[3889,["We do not really do anything; they get cured by themselves."]],[3893,["We awaken the Kundalini. We are not doing any work of that sort —"]],[3897,["that we should go and reach some hospital, take twenty-five sick people"]],[3902,["there and cure them. Because it is this love flowing"]],[3904,["from within us that cures. Jesus Christ too cured people."]],[3907,["But He did not go and sit there serving at someone's feet."]],[3910,["Human beings must understand this matter completely."]],[3913,["The mistakes that these people have made, you should not make them."]],[3917,["Your work is that you yourself should attain Self-realization."]],[3920,["After attaining Self-realization, all these powers awaken"]],[3923,["within you by themselves — meaning you can cure someone's illness."]],[3927,["Among us, many have even cured cancer — it is true! There is no lie in this."]],[3931,["Cancer can be cured only through Sahaja Yoga, and this too is the truth."]],[3934,["Now here, the one who put the garland around My neck —"]],[3937,["this lady here cured fifty-odd people."]],[3939,["I said to her, \"Stop! Why do you cure them?\" Because while doing this,"]],[3943,["it then came into her mind that these people are of no use."]],[3946,["After getting cured, they went away."]],[3948,["They do not seek God. For them it is simply"]],[3951,["that they should use God only so that their illness gets cured."]],[3954,["They do not have the idea of attaining God."]],[3956,["Why would God cure such bodies too, that are not lamps of God?"]],[3960,["Do you repair such lamps that are of no use?"]],[3962,["Such lamp-pillars are set up that give light to the whole world."]],[3967,["God too has intelligence. He is not such"]],[3969,["that He would go about curing fools like this."]],[3972,["Those human beings who do not have the power to spread the light of God and"]],[3977,["to set right the path of God, and to give"]],[3980,["something in a special way to people for that"]],[3982,["— to such people who do not do this work, no God,"]],[3986,["nothing of this kind, wishes to give anything."]],[3989,["Those people who keep themselves on such a wrong"]],[3992,["path that \"we are doing great big philanthropic work,"]],[3995,["we are doing great service to the country\""]],[3998,["— just now a gentleman telephoned me saying, \"I"]],[4001,["had gone there to give relief to people.\" I said,"]],[4004,["\"Keep giving just that; that very thing is good for you.\" Then someone said,"]],[4009,["\"I had gone to cure someone's eyes.\" Let them keep doing it —"]],[4012,["there is no harm in it. You do it — do it as an official, or do it"]],[4017,["as a human being, do it as a social worker."]],[4019,["But this is never the work of God."]],[4022,["You attach every single thing to God."]],[4024,["I have even seen this — Sainath Bidi! There should be some"]],[4028,["limit to everything. You used to attach every single thing to God —"]],[4032,["Sadhana Soap! Just imagine,"]],[4034,["is there no end to it!"]],[4035,["And Vishnu-brand asafoetida! Lakshmi-brand"]],[4038,["asafoetida! Just imagine!"]],[4039,["Have these people made a mockery of God? And what benefit is going"]],[4044,["to come to you from this? They say, \"Mother,"]],[4046,["we do it because it will be auspicious for us.\" Did"]],[4049,["it become auspicious? — \"We will earn more money.\" You are never going to earn it!"]],[4054,["If you do your business in this way,"]],[4056,["you will face great suffering."]],[4057,["This is an insult to Shri Lakshmi Herself —"]],[4060,["that they turned Her into asafoetida!"]],[4062,["In the very same way, a human being does many such"]],[4065,["things, all of which amount to misappropriation."]],[4067,["And in exactly this way, we have played"]],[4070,["this very same game with Jesus Christ as well."]],[4072,["We should understand that Jesus Christ is"]],[4074,["neither anyone's property nor anyone's possession."]],[4077,["He came into this world for the redemption"]],[4080,["and welfare of all of humankind;"]],[4081,["He is the Omkara principle of God. And it was this Omkara principle"]],[4085,["that offered itself as a sacrifice —"]],[4087,["only He can offer such a sacrifice, no one else. All the other Incarnations"]],[4091,["who came afterward — their bodies were made of the earth element,"]],[4095,["but His body was made of the Pranava"]],[4097,["principle, and that is why His resurrection took place."]],[4100,["Now, after the resurrection had happened, all those who"]],[4103,["were His disciples accepted,"]],[4104,["\"Yes, indeed, He truly was what"]],[4106,["He said He was,\" because they"]],[4108,["had seen Him in His bodily form — only then did they believe."]],[4111,["But then who was to come to give them"]],[4113,["their realization? Then they set about doing all sorts of odd things — doing"]],[4117,["this, doing that, all kinds of things from all over the world —"]],[4120,["and people began to shout and scream in the name of Jesus."]],[4123,["When they started all this screaming and shouting, evil spirits entered into them."]],[4128,["And they began to speak in all kinds of languages,"]],[4130,["and they have written this down in the Bible."]],[4133,["Now everyone thinks that this very entering of a spirit within oneself is itself"]],[4138,["the blessing of the Divine Spirit."]]]);
